<title>UK: Yorkshire Group FY hit by charges.</title>
<headline>Yorkshire Group FY hit by charges.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		0.2		    vs 16.4</p>
<p> Total dividend(pence)  9.1		    vs 8.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.81		   vs 10.57</p>
<p> Turnover		   132.2		  vs 124.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The chemicals company said an exceptional charge of 10.3 million stg linked to a review of the group's overall strategy hit full-year profits.</p>
<p>Full company name - Yorkshire Group Plc.</p>
</text>
